<title>FRANCE: France supplies food-aid wheat for Mauritania.</title>
<headline>France supplies food-aid wheat for Mauritania.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>France has awarded 3,000 tonnes of soft wheat for shipment as food aid to Mauritania, cereals office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender price was 1,144 francs per tonne for shipment in bags from Port La Nouvelle between April 22 and May 9, it said.</p>
</text>
